Subject: [PATCH] Animated splash screen and blur-in entrance

Launch shows the ReNova logo on the dark background with the renewal
arrow spinning into place and the nova spark flaring (SplashScreen API,
animated on Android 12+). The first screen then comes into focus from a
blur with a short fade and zoom (blur needs Android 12, skipped when
system animations are off). Played once per process.
